sofapilot bundles data and takes ideas from these projects.

Data: data/tvlists.json.gz (reduced to the fields used) and data/protected.json come from
tellyscope-devices, https://github.com/man15h/tellyscope-devices, MIT License.
Its device lists derive from cleanyourtv, https://github.com/Gathin23/cleanyourtv,
Copyright (c) 2026 Gathin, MIT License. Snapshot of cleanyourtv commit
8672e68e8a24c1258e4662cd11daa4ed13795dad, as recorded in tellyscope-devices.

Ideas only, no code: Tellyscope, https://github.com/man15h/tellyscope, GPL-3.0.
Its README's safety rules were read. Its code was not read and none of it is used here.
The protected list in sofapilot.py was written separately.

Tool design: Phone Harness MCP, https://github.com/phone-harness/mcp,
Copyright (c) 2026 Shawn Pana, MIT License. The set of screen, tap, type, swipe and open tools.
No code was copied.

